 prices and real local food close to Patong, and do not need a sea view.]]></description><styleUrl>#a-kathu</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>98.31255,7.93498,0 98.31296,7.93055,0 98.31493,7.92051,0 98.32082,7.90734,0 98.32178,7.89593,0 98.31486,7.87395,0 98.3191,7.87201,0 98.32174,7.87216,0 98.32856,7.87025,0 98.33038,7.87091,0 98.33162,7.87263,0 98.33647,7.87603,0 98.34161,7.87443,0 98.34402,7.87677,0 98.34529,7.87984,0 98.3525,7.88981,0 98.35696,7.89057,0 98.35803,7.89321,0 98.35892,7.89412,0 98.35908,7.89535,0 98.36142,7.89637,0 98.36102,7.89672,0 98.36178,7.89836,0 98.36221,7.89858,0 98.36304,7.89712,0 98.36424,7.89911,0 98.36523,7.89894,0 98.36577,7.90052,0 98.36684,7.90014,0 98.3681,7.90096,0 98.36778,7.90754,0 98.36715,7.90943,0 98.36578,7.90927,0 98.36408,7.91029,0 98.36198,7.91792,0 98.36387,7.92088,0 98.36477,7.92364,0 98.36522,7.93041,0 98.36655,7.93562,0 98.36609,7.93642,0 98.36172,7.93878,0 98.35966,7.94107,0 98.35378,7.94342,0 98.34958,7.94322,0 98.3484,7.94159,0 98.34739,7.94144,0 98.34354,7.94374,0 98.3426,7.94639,0 98.34173,7.94742,0 98.33654,7.94911,0 98.3278,7.94841,0 98.31823,7.94926,0 98.31308,7.94263,0 98.31255,7.93498,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>Cape Panwa</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Quiet south-east cape with calm bays and a rooftop sunset</b><br>A green, hilly cape in the south-east, about 20 minutes from Phuket Town. It is quiet: a few resorts, small bays such as Panwa Beach and Ao Yon, small beach restaurants and almost no nightlife. Phuket Aquarium is at the tip. Sri Panwa, the group behind Baba Beach Club, has its resort and the Baba Nest rooftop bar here.<br><br>Stay here if you want peace, calm water and a short drive to Phuket Town, and do not mind an hour to the airport.]]></description><styleUrl>#a-cape-panwa</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>98.37792,7.8343,0 98.37918,7.8327,0 98.37883,7.83164,0 98.38007,7.83039,0 98.38075,7.82499,0 98.38225,7.82266,0 98.38556,7.81539,0 98.38632,7.81109,0 98.38583,7.80881,0 98.38914,7.80541,0 98.38986,7.80621,0 98.38994,7.80827,0 98.38899,7.80949,0 98.38998,7.8114,0 98.39205,7.81295,0 98.394,7.81329,0 98.39398,7.81434,0 98.39496,7.81432,0 98.39715,7.81371,0 98.39769,7.81193,0 98.40042,7.80917,0 98.40002,7.80801,0 98.40089,7.80716,0 98.40207,7.80635,0 98.40433,7.80608,0 98.40677,7.80447,0 98.40829,7.80117,0 98.40827,7.79921,0 98.40896,7.79964,0 98.41024,7.7992,0 98.41178,7.80094,0 98.41248,7.80102,0 98.41249,7.80246,0 98.41123,7.80276,0 98.41043,7.80495,0 98.41057,7.80825,0 98.40923,7.80851,0 98.4084,7.81025,0 98.40789,7.81042,0 98.40651,7.80969,0 98.40632,7.80875,0 98.40535,7.80857,0 98.40474,7.80885,0 98.40221,7.812,0 98.40217,7.81521,0 98.40306,7.81627,0 98.40432,7.81553,0 98.40525,7.81706,0 98.40646,7.81705,0 98.40588,7.81856,0 98.40628,7.81871,0 98.40514,7.82175,0 98.40447,7.8215,0 98.40358,7.82377,0 98.40169,7.82318,0 98.40086,7.82411,0 98.40223,7.82667,0 98.403,7.82753,0 98.40426,7.82715,0 98.40563,7.82966,0 98.40435,7.8302,0 98.40279,7.82971,0 98.40236,7.8302,0 98.40189,7.83256,0 98.40282,7.83504,0 98.40548,7.83565,0 98.40709,7.83493,0 98.40782,7.83511,0 98.40875,7.83635,0 98.40996,7.83633,0 98.41035,7.8375,0 98.40945,7.83843,0 98.40845,7.83838,0 98.40751,7.83915,0 98.40587,7.8384,0 98.40449,7.83901,0 98.40283,7.83745,0 98.40202,7.83767,0 98.40212,7.83856,0 98.4013,7.83904,0 98.39828,7.83925,0 98.39733,7.83824,0 98.39688,7.83861,0 98.39718,7.8398,0 98.39577,7.8424,0 98.39565,7.84549,0 98.37859,7.83568,0 98.37792,7.8343,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></MultiGeometry></Placemark><Placemark><name>Ao Po &amp; Cape Yamu</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Marinas, luxury villas and boats to Koh Yao</b><br>The quiet north-east coast, facing the limestone islands of Phang Nga Bay. Ao Po Grand Marina has yachts, charters and resort boats to Koh Yao Noi (about 40 minutes); public speedboats leave from Bang Rong Pier nearby. Cape Yamu, to the south, has luxury villas and COMO Point Yamu. Almost no shops or nightlife.<br><br>Stay here if you want a private luxury villa with Phang Nga Bay views and easy boats to Koh Yao, not a beach holiday.]]></description><styleUrl>#a-ao-po</styleUrl><MultiGeometry><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>98.36969,7.99339,0 98.37008,7.99225,0 98.37256,7.98962,0 98.37334,7.98957,0 98.37513,7.98738,0 98.37629,7.98726,0 98.37733,7.98606,0 98.37868,7.98585,0 98.37903,7.98616,0 98.37981,7.98393,0 98.38297,7.98343,0 98.38304,7.98412,0 98.38448,7.98458,0 98.38474,7.98348,0 98.38573,7.98354,0 98.38583,7.9825,0 98.38624,7.98277,0 98.38645,7.98385,0 98.38579,7.98464,0 98.38602,7.98516,0 98.38762,7.98476,0 98.38848,7.98356,0 98.38943,7.98422,0 98.38974,7.98289,0 98.38927,7.98144,0 98.38962,7.98038,0 98.39099,7.98005,0 98.39206,7.9804,0 98.39354,7.98306,0 98.39594,7.98211,0 98.39624,7.98273,0 98.39851,7.98352,0 98.39953,7.98442,0 98.39936,7.98499,0 98.39686,7.98609,0 98.3973,7.98722,0 98.39894,7.98859,0 98.39923,7.98866,0 98.39887,7.98753,0 98.39771,7.98688,0 98.39804,7.98619,0 98.39981,7.98613,0 98.40401,7.9886,0 98.40421,7.98893,0 98.4034,7.98991,0 98.40361,7.99062,0 98.40258,7.99062,0 98.40242,7.99102,0 98.40291,7.99061,0 98.40352,7.99108,0 98.40384,7.99048,0 98.40361,7.98982,0 98.4048,7.98921,0 98.40626,7.99021,0 98.40672,7.99015,0 98.40668,7.99052,0 98.40748,7.99056,0 98.40728,7.99131,0 98.40761,7.9914,0 98.4079,7.9907,0 98.40855,7.99103,0 98.40914,7.99081,0 98.40912,7.99116,0 98.40938,7.99088,0 98.40948,7.99154,0 98.41027,7.99111,0 98.41198,7.99136,0 98.41543,7.9903,0 98.41839,7.98898,0 98.4201,7.98662,0 98.42099,7.98406,0 98.42142,7.98398,0 98.42282,7.98547,0 98.42353,7.98561,0 98.42454,7.98495,0 98.42496,7.98622,0 98.42599,7.98733,0 98.42606,7.98853,0 98.42546,7.98863,0 98.42386,7.98747,0 98.42238,7.98801,0 98.41946,7.99118,0 98.41817,7.99385,0 98.41786,7.99368,0 98.41494,7.9958,0 98.41362,7.99996,0 98.410